   4×  C3         | User:MING | kafka.DescribeConfigs
   4×  C3         | User:MING | kafka.CreateTopics
   3×  REST Proxy | User:YUJIE | kafka.Metadata
   2×  REST Proxy | User:legacy-orders | kafka.Metadata
   2×  REST Proxy | User:YUJIE | kafka.Produce
   1×  REST Proxy | User:legacy-orders | kafka.Produce
   1×  REST Proxy | User:legacy-other | kafka.Metadata
   1×  REST Proxy | User:MING | kafka.Produce
